      "html": "<details class=\"ds-stage\" open><summary><span class=\"ds-number\">02</span><span>Evaluate<small>SmooveOperator</small></span></summary><p>We assess marketplace eligibility, channel permissions, demand and the full cost of an order.</p></details>",
